net":"Naboo","levelId":"Levels/MP/Naboo_01/Naboo_01","tile":null,"loading":null,"_source":"UI/Data/GameModes/Levels/TheedCity#LevelInformationAsset"},"TheedCity_02":{"key":"Naboo_02","asset":"UI/Data/GameModes/Levels/TheedCity_02","name":"#8FA0362B","description":"#B55D5B29","overrides":{"HeroesVersusVillains":"#3C5CACBB","Mode6":"#9D6DB5E0","SkirmishBlast":"#F247AF07","SkirmishOnslaught":"#0971E31C","SkirmishDuel":"#C7F00C71"},"aurebesh":"NABOO","planet":"Naboo","levelId":"Levels/MP/Naboo_02/Naboo_02","tile":null,"loading":null,"_source":"UI/Data/GameModes/Levels/TheedCity_02#LevelInformationAsset"}},"planets":{"Bespin":{"id":"Bespin","asset":"S2/UI/Data/GameModes/Planets/Bespin","name":"#587C9D8B","index":16,"_source":"S2/UI/Data/GameModes/Planets/Bespin#PlanetInformationAsset"},"JabbasPalace":{"id":"JabbasPalace","asset":"S2_2/UI/Data/GameModes/Planets/JabbasPalace","name":"#D518808D","index":17,"_source":"S2_2/UI/Data/GameModes/Planets/JabbasPalace#PlanetInformationAsset"},"Kessel":{"id":"Kessel","asset":"S3/UI/Data/GameModes/Planets/Kessel","name":"#6D7B1771","index":18,"_source":"S3/UI/Data/GameModes/Planets/Kessel#PlanetInformationAsset"},"DeathStar02":{"id":"DeathStar02","asset":"UI/Data/GameModes/Planets/DeathStar02","name":"#EBC51C9A","index":3,"_source":"UI/Data/GameModes/Planets/DeathStar02#PlanetInformationAsset"},"Endor":{"id":"Endor","asset":"UI/Data/GameModes/Planets/Endor","name":"#86CA62A2","index":4,"_source":"UI/Data/GameModes/Planets/Endor#PlanetInformationAsset"},"Felucia":{"id":"Felucia","asset":"UI/Data/GameModes/Planets/Felucia","name":"#9B7D3A63","index":20,"_source":"UI/Data/GameModes/Planets/Felucia#PlanetInformationAsset"},"Fondor":{"id":"Fondor","asset":"UI/Data/GameModes/Planets/Fondor","name":"#628344F2","index":11,"_source":"UI/Data/GameModes/Planets/Fondor#PlanetInformationAsset"},"Hoth":{"id":"Hoth","asset":"UI/Data/GameModes/Planets/Hoth","name":"#098CDEC4","index":5,"_source":"UI/Data/GameModes/Planets/Hoth#PlanetInformationAsset"},"Kamino":{"id":"Kamino","asset":"UI/Data/GameModes/Planets/Kamino","name":"#6D2F41C9","index":8,"_source":"UI/Data/GameModes/Planets/Kamino#PlanetInformationAsset"},"Kashyyyk":{"id":"Kashyyyk","asset":"UI/Data/GameModes/Planets/Kashyyyk","name":"#1383B1EE","index":9,"_source":"UI/Data/GameModes/Planets/Kashyyyk#PlanetInformationAsset"},"Naboo":{"id":"Naboo","asset":"UI/Data/GameModes/Planets/Naboo","name":"#876615B9","index":10,"_source":"UI/Data/GameModes/Planets/Naboo#PlanetInformationAsset"},"Ryloth":{"id":"Ryloth","asset":"UI/Data/GameModes/Planets/Ryloth","name":"#7F35382C","index":12,"_source":"UI/Data/GameModes/Planets/Ryloth#PlanetInformationAsset"},"Tatooine":{"id":"Tatooine","asset":"UI/Data/GameModes/Planets/Tatooine","name":"#D518808D","index":6,"_source":"UI/Data/GameModes/Planets/Tatooine#PlanetInformationAsset"},"UnknownRegions":{"id":"UnknownRegions","asset":"UI/Data/GameModes/Planets/UnknownRegions","name":"#64978DB0","index":13,"_source":"UI/Data/GameModes/Planets/UnknownRegions#PlanetInformationAsset"},"Yavin":{"id":"Yavin","asset":"UI/Data/GameModes/Planets/Yavin","name":"#882D7791","index":7,"_source":"UI/Data/GameModes/Planets/Yavin#PlanetInformationAsset"}},"strings":{"#01D85D89":"COMMAND SECTOR NORTH","#024D3ED8":"Unrest stirs in the seat of Jabba the Hutt's criminal empire. The infamous gangster's palace has attracted unwanted attention... of both the Rebel and Imperial variety.","#074C0EF7":"Two teams of eight players compete in objective-based scenarios.","#0971E31C":"Onslaught is the ultimate test of speed and strength. Can you wipe out the opposing troopers within the time limit?","#0977C6D4":"The Resistance have located a scavenged Imperial droid containing data valuable to their fight against the First Order. Knowing this, the First Order move in to try to stop them….","#098CDEC4":"HOTH","#0B0AC1A5":"Resistance and First Order infantry forces clash in deadly combat.","#0B1CF284":"KACHIRHO BEACH","#101B6D54":"Survive a night on Endor.","#1383B1EE":"KASHYYYK","#14F49AD5":"Go up against the enemy team of AI opponents. Capture one of the Command Posts to continue the battle into the next phase. ","#16E35C86":"In a desperate attempt to steal important data on the Imperial Fleet, the Rebels launch a small strike team to infiltrate the mighty Battle Station….","#17CAB722":"After a failed attempt to push the Clone Army back from Kashyyyk, the Separatists launch a second wave aimed at taking out an imposing Venator-class Star Destroyer….","#1C59EE68":"EXTRACTION","#1CD5934E":"SUPREMACY","#1E33E54A":"OUTPOST DELTA","#1E4E3648":"The Galactic Republic musters all its remaining strength to secure a Felucian farming community and retrieve a cache of valuable medicinal plants - a final offensive that the Separatists mobilize to thwart swiftly.","#1EE72671":"The Separatists launch a second assault on Theed, the capital of Naboo, with the intent of capturing the Palace and forcing a complete surrender….","#1F0ACD47":"During the Battle of Endor, a blockade runner has crash landed into the second Death Star's hangar. The survivors must find a way to escape the Battle Station before it's too late….","#20522A34":"Pit STAR WARS' greatest characters against one another in four-on-four team battles, as the Light Side and Dark Side collide!","#2536AB55":"With intelligence pointing to a research facility still operating on the forest moon, the Rebels launch a bold attack against the base hoping to secure any resources before the Empire is able to evacuate….","#284D1E07":"In hopes of creating a diversion, brave saboteurs destroy Imperial supply caches. Maybe this will give their transport ships a window to escape….","#294B4E59":"PIPELINE JUNCTION WEST","#2A048176":"EWOK HUNT","#2FAD4D1E":"Starfighter Onslaught is the ultimate test of speed and strength. Can you wipe out the rival starfighters within the time limit?","#2FD5B789":"MISSIONS (ATTACK)","#312DD139":"STRIKE","#351D2FAE":"Imperial probe droids have detected Rebel activity at Jabba’s Palace. The Empire unleashes a strike force as the Rebellion is preparing to escape with black market ion disruptors that could turn the tides of war","#3534A1EA":"MOS EISLEY","#3572BA4E":"During the Battle of Starkiller Base, the Resistance makes a desperate attempt to free any prisoners held at the Command Center before it's too late….","#3C5CACBB":"Heroes and Villains from all eras of STAR WARS™ clash in deadly combat.","#3D79A8ED":"Jetpacks and rocket launchers fuel the action in a frantic race to secure precious cargo!","#4928507A":"JABBA'S PALACE","#4B0F84FD":"BLAST","#4B28F8C1":"STARFIGHTER ASSAULT","#4BD8427D":"Armies collide both on and above the battlefront in this objective-based tug-of-war. Ground forces must compete for control of command posts, determined to board the enemy's capital ship and destroy it from within.","#4BD84281":"EXTRACTION","#4BD84282":"HERO SHOWDOWN","#4BD84283":"HERO STARFIGHTERS","#4C15A7BE":"STARFIGHTER ONSLAUGHT","#4CF5F648":"Imperial intelligence has been monitoring rumors of a growing Rebel presence in Mos Eisley. Now, they launch a surprise raid in hopes of clearing this infestation….","#53886C8E":"The Separatists have launched an attack against the cloning facility on Kamino.","#54FC48CD":"GALACTIC ASSAULT","#57B61225":"The First Order have information pointing to Resistance spies and sympathizers at Maz’s Castle. They launch an attack to capture them, but Resistance forces have arrived in time to oppose them….","#587C9D8B":"BESPIN","#597F4A30":"COMMAND CENTER","#5F014D2B":"A Star Destroyer is undergoing repairs in a maintenance dock above Fondor. The Rebel Alliance launches a surprise assault to destroy it….","#6062EAF6":"THE GRAVEYARD","#60EF7190":"After the Imperial occupation of the gas giant Bespin, Rebel command fears the Empire will strengthen their foothold in the sector. They dispatch a strike team to Cloud City, hoping to disrupt Imperial mining operations of precious Tibanna gas….","#61DCD17D":"ONSLAUGHT","#628344F2":"FONDOR","#6443D473":"THEED","#64978DB0":"UNKNOWN REGIONS","#65225EED":"IMPERIAL SHIPYARD","#6A3C13C4":"Go up against the enemy team of AI opponents. Prevent the enemies from capturing any of your Command Posts to stop their advance.","#6D2F41C9":"KAMINO","#6D7B1771":"KESSEL","#6F925271":"INSTANT ACTION","#6FCE5BC4":"RESEARCH OUTPOST","#717E4F0D":"SEPARATIST DREADNOUGHT","#7B1DBEE8":"CO-OP MISSIONS","#7BEFBAD7":"RESEARCH STATION 9","#7C8EB48F":"The droid army gears up to fend off the fearless troopers of the Galactic Republic, as the ferocious battle begins within the Separatist Dreadnought.","#7E64E1EA":"TAGATA","#7F35382C":"RYLOTH","#7F9A897B":"The Rebels may have destroyed the second Death Star, but the Imperials are determined to make a fighting retreat. An Imperial Star Destroyer struggles to down an emboldened Mon Calamari Star Cruiser and its escort of Rebel frigates….","#81AF9FA7":"MAZ'S CASTLE","#86CA62A2":"ENDOR","#876615B9":"NABOO","#882D7791":"YAVIN 4","#8984FF4B":"Battle on a series of large team-oriented, objective-based maps. Visit iconic locations, pilot favorite vehicles, choose from among four trooper classes, call in special units, and become a hero.","#8B41E064":"The First Order have learned that Maz's Castle might be the location of a sought after Jedi artifact. But the Resistance aren't going to let them take it without a fight….","#8EA0A93D":"DEATH STAR DEBRIS","#8FA0362B":"PALACE HANGAR","#91C3EABB":"Armies collide to dominate the battlefront in an open-ended tug-of-war. Utilize a wide array of tactics, trooper classes, land vehicles, reinforcement units, and hero characters to attack and defend strategic assets in this era-authentic mode.","#9B188D3F":"Deep within the Kessel mines, an infiltration squad is on a high-risk mission to retrieve vital coaxium for the Rebellion. Imperial forces have been alerted however and are intent on crushing any hopes of rendezvousing with their ride home – the Millennium Falcon.","#9B7D3A63":"FELUCIA","#9CAEE2CF":"CLONING FACILITY","#9D640B36":"Notorious for its treacherous spice mines, Kessel also serves as a valuable source of coaxium, the fuel source which powers the Imperial fleet. Nestled deep within one of the most dangerous sectors of the Outer Rim, Kessel is considered as impenetrable to unwanted guests as it is inescapable.","#9D6DB5E0":"STAR WARS' most iconic characters pair up against each other in two-vs-two elimination showdowns. Even heroes must work together to survive!","#9D6E5311":"DUEL","#9FC2DE81":"STAR WARS' most heroic pilots dog-fighting against each other in elimination showdowns. Even heroes must work together to survive!","#A22D0AB9":"Separatists and Republic infantry forces clash in deadly combat.","#A46D2FC3":"Join a squad of four players and go up against the enemy team of AI opponents. As an attacker, capture one of the Command Posts to continue the battle into the next phase. As a defender, prevent the enemies from capturing any of your Command Posts to stop their advance.","#A50396FA":"STRIKE / EXTRACTION","#A9639BF6":"Separatist forces have laid siege to a Geonosian droid factory occupied by a Republic demolitions crew. With time running out to destroy the facility, the last remaining clone strike team must push back the droids to prevent them from retaking the factory.","#A97957A7":"The Rebels have determined that a thorough scan of Yavin 4's databases would reveal the location of their new secret base. Unable to let this information fall into enemy hands, the Rebels launch a strike mission with hopes of retrieving this data….","#AADD3AA5":"MISSIONS (DEFEND)","#ACED10F0":"Rebel and Imperial infantry forces clash in deadly combat.","#B55D5B29":"The Trade Federation's failed blockade of Naboo elevated the idyllic world into a political powerhouse. Sheev Palpatine, Naboo's senator, was named Supreme Chancellor. Secretly a Sith Lord, Palpatine stoked the conflicts which incited the Clone Wars, eventually consolidating power to become the tyrant known as the Emperor.","#C0FDEA13":"LUCREHULK-CLASS BATTLESHIP","#C1C49CAE":"As a Separatist infiltration task force launches an assault on the Republic Attack Cruiser, the clones brace themselves to fight back against the threat of devastation.","#C7793C36":"After the Imperial occupation of the gas giant Bespin, Rebel command fears the Empire will strengthen their foothold in the sector. They dispatch a strike team to Cloud City, hoping to disrupt Imperial mining operations of precious Tibanna gas….","#C7F00C71":"Duel is a one-on-one, split screen showdown. Settle the score between light and dark side once and for all.","#C91CCB47":"With islets, palm trees, and crystal clear waters, the beautiful scenery of the tropical Scarif is contrasted by towering Imperial facilities and a Rebel surprise attack.","#C9F8750D":"In hopes of tipping the scales for the main attack on Starkiller Base, a Resistance strike team infiltrates the facility. Their goal: to sabotage Special Forces TIE fighters before they can take to the skies….","#CA68BD3B":"Blast invites players to leap into fast paced, close quarters combat.","#CC952B7F":"Two teams of pilots take control of fighters, bombers, interceptors, and hero ships and engage in multi-stage, objective based space battles.","#D1058E4D":"The Separatists have launched an attack against a cloning facility on Kamino hoping to shut down the production for good.\n","#D3B9F032":"ADMINISTRATOR'S PALACE","#D518808D":"TATOOINE","#D6E655A8":"The Empire has found a secret Rebel base on Hoth. They launch a full-scale assault across the frozen wastes, hoping to prevent their enemies from escaping….","#D6F9B256":"HEROES VS VILLAINS","#DAC3308C":"Hoping to gain the upper hand in the war against the Republic, the Separatists have sent a strike team to Kamino to obtain more information on the enemy clones….","#DD177ED7":"REPUBLIC ATTACK CRUISER","#DEEABBE1":"In order to weaken the Republic's strategic hold on Kashyyyk, the Separatists launch an attack aimed at deactivating command posts hidden amidst the Wroshyr trees….","#E14F2DFF":"STARFIGHTER BLAST","#E81E2D67":"An Imperial Strike team manages to infiltrate the Rebel Base. Their goal is to sabotage the dangerous Ion Cannon threatening the Imperial fleet….","#E8B86A18":"COAXIUM MINE","#EB83A198":"CO-OP MISSIONS","#EBC51C9A":"DEATH STAR II","#ECCB9194":"Rebels infiltrate an Imperial Base on forest moon of Endor. They hope to secure secret research data that will help them finish their struggle against the Empire….","#ED56DF96":"JETPACK CARGO","#EEC65FE8":"Licking its wounds from the Battle of Yavin, the Empire attacks the Rebel base in the Great Temple in hopes of acquiring data that would undermine the power of the Alliance fleet….","#F114878A":"THE GREAT TEMPLE","#F16FC011":"The Galactic Republic has come to the aid of a ship in distress only to find that they have been lured into a trap by a massive Lucrehulk Battleship. Now the two sides engage in a desperate battle for Ryloth….","#F23C3AB0":"The Separatist army has detected that several LAAT/I gunships have landed in the city. In order to prevent a Republic evacuation, these gunships must be destroyed….","#F247AF07":"Two teams fight it out in classic infantry combat. The first team to eliminate the other team's troops wins.","#F72B235F":"Two teams of pilots duke it out in classic starfighter combat. The first team to eliminate their opponents' forces wins.","#FB1C5493":"The Resistance has recovered vital information from one of the derelict Star Destroyers on Jakku. As the Resistance try to take the info off planet, the First Order moves in to stop them….","#FB339B89":"SCARIF BEACH","#FD694819":"Single player epic battles against AI opponents offline. Take control over a majority of Command Posts to gain reinforcements and defeat the enemy team."},"_skipped":["S1/UI/Data/GameModes/Levels/Crait_01","S1/UI/Data/GameModes/Levels/Crait_02","S1/UI/Data/GameModes/Levels/SB_SpaceBe